{"2637940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Used Cars Simulator", "steam_appid": 2637940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of trading used (or stolen) cars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got little money and nothing to lose? We were waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Used Cars Simulator</strong>, you’ll fix up cars, put them up for sale, grow your business in an old shed, drive around an abandoned city, drink beer, and wander the desert with a metal detector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it all starts when you meet a beautiful woman in a red dress at your favorite bar… Are you in?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>FIND A GOOD OFFER</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/25a945a97906e52de7e8fcacf90123fc.poster.avif?t=1787127882\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/25a945a97906e52de7e8fcacf90123fc.webm?t=1787127882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/25a945a97906e52de7e8fcacf90123fc.mp4?t=1787127882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Used Cars Simulator</strong>, you'll learn how to make money by trading cars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, find a good deal. Check the car’s condition, negotiate the price, and if everything looks good - just buy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>FIX THE CAR</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/1d3f6c598b4cdb19ab160785bd8c8864.poster.avif?t=1787127882\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/1d3f6c598b4cdb19ab160785bd8c8864.webm?t=1787127882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/1d3f6c598b4cdb19ab160785bd8c8864.mp4?t=1787127882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix the dents, order and install missing parts, wash the car, repaint it, and put it up for sale. If it wasn’t yours, you’d probably want to buy it yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>BE BAD</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/ac9bf1ace70daad8ac4310f563862b91.poster.avif?t=1787127882\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/ac9bf1ace70daad8ac4310f563862b91.webm?t=1787127882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/ac9bf1ace70daad8ac4310f563862b91.mp4?t=1787127882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Used Cars Simulator,</strong> there are many ways to get cars. Are they all legal? Sure - as long as the cops don’t catch you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>HAVE FUN</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/e0245694a16732a21b570f145122986d.poster.avif?t=1787127882\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/e0245694a16732a21b570f145122986d.webm?t=1787127882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/e0245694a16732a21b570f145122986d.mp4?t=1787127882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After work, have some fun - drift, jump, and compare your scores with other players on the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>PROGRESS</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What’s coming in future updates? You tell us! Let us know which features we should add.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features of Used Cars Simulator:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Car Trading &amp; Flipping</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Story &amp; Quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Physics &amp; Sandbox</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Illegal Activities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Police Interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ World Exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Upgrades &amp; Economy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of trading used (or stolen) cars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got little money and nothing to lose? We were waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Used Cars Simulator</strong>, you’ll fix up cars, put them up for sale, grow your business in an old shed, drive around an abandoned city, drink beer, and wander the desert with a metal detector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it all starts when you meet a beautiful woman in a red dress at your favorite bar… Are you in?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>FIND A GOOD OFFER</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/25a945a97906e52de7e8fcacf90123fc.poster.avif?t=1787127882\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/25a945a97906e52de7e8fcacf90123fc.webm?t=1787127882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/25a945a97906e52de7e8fcacf90123fc.mp4?t=1787127882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Used Cars Simulator</strong>, you'll learn how to make money by trading cars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, find a good deal. Check the car’s condition, negotiate the price, and if everything looks good - just buy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>FIX THE CAR</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/1d3f6c598b4cdb19ab160785bd8c8864.poster.avif?t=1787127882\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/1d3f6c598b4cdb19ab160785bd8c8864.webm?t=1787127882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/1d3f6c598b4cdb19ab160785bd8c8864.mp4?t=1787127882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix the dents, order and install missing parts, wash the car, repaint it, and put it up for sale. If it wasn’t yours, you’d probably want to buy it yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>BE BAD</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/ac9bf1ace70daad8ac4310f563862b91.poster.avif?t=1787127882\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/ac9bf1ace70daad8ac4310f563862b91.webm?t=1787127882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/ac9bf1ace70daad8ac4310f563862b91.mp4?t=1787127882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Used Cars Simulator,</strong> there are many ways to get cars. Are they all legal? Sure - as long as the cops don’t catch you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>HAVE FUN</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/e0245694a16732a21b570f145122986d.poster.avif?t=1787127882\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/e0245694a16732a21b570f145122986d.webm?t=1787127882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/e0245694a16732a21b570f145122986d.mp4?t=1787127882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After work, have some fun - drift, jump, and compare your scores with other players on the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>PROGRESS</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What’s coming in future updates? You tell us! Let us know which features we should add.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features of Used Cars Simulator:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Car Trading &amp; Flipping</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Story &amp; Quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Physics &amp; Sandbox</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Illegal Activities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Police Interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ World Exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Upgrades &amp; Economy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Used Cars Simulator - trade used or stolen cars, fix and customize them, drive around, and explore the open world! Grow your business, complete quests, and have fun with a physics-based sandbox!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/d82b9b4c2fbd37bf0a7834929a271436f1a05a20/header.jpg?t=1787127882", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/f421c44acbf4484a7786f7310813d93ef0e6ed5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787127882", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/f421c44acbf4484a7786f7310813d93ef0e6ed5d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787127882", "website": "https://dreamwaygames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3-4130 @ 3.3GHz / AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX1050ti / R9 280<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> System Requirements subject to change as development continues</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  i7-9700 @ 3.6 GHz or Ryzen 5 3600 @ 3.6 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br><